'''Kenari Village'''<ref name="Insider">{{InsiderCite|219|Galactic Britain II: Cassian's Travels}}</ref> was a village located on the [[planet]] [[Kenari]]. The village consisted of several homes that were made of [[wood]] and scrap materials. The settlement was inhabited<ref name="Kassa" /> by a [[Alpha (Kenari)|tribe]] consisting of child orphans.<ref name="Encyclopedia">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> Tribes of orphaned children<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|kenari|Kenari}}</ref> like them were the only survivors from the planet being poisoned by mining operations.<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> The tribe included [[Cassian Jeron Andor|Kassa]] and his little sister [[Kerri]].<ref name="Kassa" /> When a [[Galactic Republic]] transport crashed on Kenari, an expedition making up most of the tribe left the settlement to inspect the crash site.<ref name="That Would Be Me">{{Andor|That Would Be Me}}</ref>

